Z||000000||Santa Cruzer||09-08-2001||12:29 AM||||it's been one thing after another with this piece of sh!t ,first it didn't pass emmission's,then  my heater core blows all over the passenger side floor, then my left light get's stuck every now and again,everytime i come to a sudden stop at a light the car does a peel out when i hit the gas again,it's been backfiringing every now and again my sunroof now leaks a bit the only thing that stop's me from getting ride of this thing is pride! i always spoke highly of the car and now it's starting to give me problems one after the other,did i mention there's a new problem that aroused about an hour ago? no? well THE TRANNY SEEMS TO BE SLIPPING!     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> every time i slam the gas as soon as it hit's 80 the car just revs up and down ,i have another tranny but that's not the point ,this car is my daily driver and is really STARTIN TO PISS  ME OFF!,any idea' about the tranny problem i have?     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> for a pic of the car goto my webpage, btw i touched up the nose and it look alote better...i may be graduateing to a 3rd gen Trans Am any idea on what the gas milege would be on a 305HO?<P>------------------ <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierose_1986/dts.html" TARGET=_blank>www.geociies.com/fierose_1986/dts.html</A> <P><p>[This message has been edited by Santa Cruzer (edited 09-08-2001).]||||reg||8
